{
 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Week 3: 整合專案 - Olist 多維度分析系統\n",
    "\n",
    "## 專案概述\n",
    "本專案整合 MultiIndex、GroupBy 和 Pivot 技術，建立一個完整的 Olist 電商數據分析系統。\n",
    "\n",
    "### 主要功能:\n",
    "1. 多維度銷售分析\n",
    "2. 產品績效評估\n",
    "3. 客戶分群分析\n",
    "4. 區域銷售對標\n",
    "5. 時間序列趨勢\n",
    "6. 綜合儀表板\n",
    "\n",
    "---"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Step 1: 環境設置與資料載入"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": {"text/plain": "\"## Step 1: 環境設置與資料載入\""}, "source": "## Step 1: 環境設置與資料載入"
  },
  {
   "cell_type": ["code", "execution_count": null, "metadata": {}, "outputs": [], "source": ["import pandas as pd\n", "import numpy as np\n", "import sys\n", "import warnings\n", "warnings.filterwarnings('ignore')\n", "\n", "# 設置顯示\n", "pd.set_option('display.max_columns', None)\n", "pd.set_option('display.max_rows', 100)\n", "pd.set_option('display.width', None)\n", "pd.set_option('display.float_format', lambda x: f'{x:,.2f}' if abs(x) > 100 else f'{x:.2f}')\n", "\n", "# 載入數據\n", "sys.path.append('../../utils')\n", "from data_loader import load_olist_data\n", "\n", "orders, order_items, products, customers, sellers, payments, reviews = load_olist_data()\n", "\n", "print(\"✅ 環境設置完成\")"]]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": {"text/plain": "\"## Step 2: 建立 MultiIndex 結構\""}, "source": "## Step 2: 建立 MultiIndex 結構"
  },
  {
   "cell_type": ["code", "execution_count": null, "metadata": {}, "outputs": [], "source": ["print(\"\\n\" + \"=\"*60)\n", "print(\"Step 2: 建立 MultiIndex 結構\")\n", "print(\"=\"*60)\n", "\n", "# 準備集成數據\n", "df_integrated = orders.merge(order_items, on='order_id') \\\n", "    .merge(products[['product_id', 'product_category_name']], on='product_id') \\\n", "    .merge(customers[['customer_id', 'customer_state']], on='customer_id') \\\n", "    .merge(reviews[['order_id', 'review_score']], on='order_id', how='left')\n", "\n", "# 添加時間屬性\n", "df_integrated['order_date'] = pd.to_datetime(df_integrated['order_purchase_timestamp'])\n", "df_integrated['year'] = df_integrated['order_date'].dt.year\n", "df_integrated['month'] = df_integrated['order_date'].dt.month\n", "df_integrated['year_month'] = df_integrated['order_date'].dt.to_period('M')\n", "\n", "# 建立 MultiIndex 數據\n", "multi_index = df_integrated.set_index([\n", "    'customer_state', \n", "    'product_category_name', \n", "    'year_month'\n", "])\n", "\n", "print(f\"\\nMultiIndex 數據形狀: {multi_index.shape}\")\n", "print(f\"索引級別: {multi_index.index.nlevels}\")\n", "print(f\"索引名稱: {multi_index.index.names}\")\n", "print(f\"\\n前 10 行:\")\n", "print(multi_index[['price', 'review_score']].head(10))"]]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": {"text/plain": "\"## Step 3: 計算各維度 KPI\""}, "source": "## Step 3: 計算各維度 KPI"
  },
  {
   "cell_type": ["code", "execution_count": null, "metadata": {}, "outputs": [], "source": ["print(\"\\n\" + \"=\"*60)\n", "print(\"Step 3: 計算各維度 KPI\")\n", "print(\"=\"*60)\n", "\n", "# 3.1 州級 KPI\n", "print(\"\\n3.1 州級 KPI\")\n", "state_kpi = df_integrated.groupby('customer_state').agg({\n", "    'price': ['sum', 'mean', 'count'],\n", "    'order_id': 'nunique',\n", "    'review_score': 'mean'\n", "})\n", "\n", "state_kpi.columns = ['Total_Sales', 'Avg_Item_Price', 'Item_Count', 'Orders', 'Avg_Rating']\n", "state_kpi = state_kpi.sort_values('Total_Sales', ascending=False)\n", "\n", "print(f\"\\n銷售額排名前 10 的州:\")\n", "print(state_kpi.head(10))\n", "\n", "# 3.2 類別 KPI\n", "print(\"\\n3.2 產品類別 KPI\")\n", "category_kpi = df_integrated.groupby('product_category_name').agg({\n", "    'price': ['sum', 'mean', 'count'],\n", "    'order_id': 'nunique',\n", "    'review_score': 'mean'\n", "})\n", "\n", "category_kpi.columns = ['Total_Sales', 'Avg_Price', 'Item_Count', 'Orders', 'Avg_Rating']\n", "category_kpi = category_kpi.sort_values('Total_Sales', ascending=False)\n", "\n", "print(f\"\\n銷售額排名前 10 的類別:\")\n", "print(category_kpi.head(10))\n", "\n", "# 3.3 時間 KPI\n", "print(\"\\n3.3 月度 KPI\")\n", "monthly_kpi = df_integrated.groupby('year_month').agg({\n", "    'price': ['sum', 'mean', 'count'],\n", "    'order_id': 'nunique',\n", "    'review_score': 'mean'\n", "})\n", "\n", "monthly_kpi.columns = ['Total_Sales', 'Avg_Price', 'Item_Count', 'Orders', 'Avg_Rating']\n", "\n", "print(f\"\\n月度銷售數據:\")\n", "print(monthly_kpi)"]]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": {"text/plain": "\"## Step 4: 生成透視表報表\""}, "source": "## Step 4: 生成透視表報表"
  },
  {
   "cell_type": ["code", "execution_count": null, "metadata": {}, "outputs": [], "source": ["print(\"\\n\" + \"=\"*60)\n", "print(\"Step 4: 生成透視表報表\")\n", "print(\"=\"*60)\n", "\n", "# 4.1 州-類別透視表\n", "print(\"\\n4.1 州-類別銷售透視表\")\n", "pivot_state_category = pd.pivot_table(\n", "    df_integrated,\n", "    values='price',\n", "    index='customer_state',\n", "    columns='product_category_name',\n", "    aggfunc='sum',\n", "    fill_value=0\n", ")\n", "\n", "pivot_state_category['Total'] = pivot_state_category.sum(axis=1)\n", "pivot_state_category = pivot_state_category.sort_values('Total', ascending=False)\n", "\n", "print(f\"\\n州-類別銷售透視表 (前 5 州, 前 5 類別):\")\n", "print(pivot_state_category.iloc[:5, :5])\n", "\n", "# 4.2 時間-州透視表\n", "print(\"\\n4.2 時間-州銷售透視表\")\n", "pivot_time_state = pd.pivot_table(\n", "    df_integrated,\n", "    values='price',\n", "    index='year_month',\n", "    columns='customer_state',\n", "    aggfunc='sum',\n", "    fill_value=0\n", ")\n", "\n", "print(f\"\\n前 6 個月的州別銷售:\")\n", "print(pivot_time_state.head(6))\n", "\n", "# 4.3 訂單狀態分析\n", "print(\"\\n4.3 訂單狀態分析\")\n", "pivot_status = pd.pivot_table(\n", "    df_integrated,\n", "    values='order_id',\n", "    index='customer_state',\n", "    columns='order_status',\n", "    aggfunc='count',\n", "    fill_value=0\n", ")\n", "\n", "print(f\"\\n訂單狀態分布:\")\n", "print(pivot_status)"]]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": {"text/plain": "\"## Step 5: 視覺化與輸出\""}, "source": "## Step 5: 視覺化與輸出"
  },
  {
   "cell_type": ["code", "execution_count": null, "metadata": {}, "outputs": [], "source": ["print(\"\\n\" + \"=\"*60)\n", "print(\"Step 5: 生成分析報表\")\n", "print(\"=\"*60)\n", "\n", "# 5.1 整體業績摘要\n", "print(\"\\n5.1 整體業績摘要\")\n", "summary_metrics = {\n", "    '總訂單數': df_integrated['order_id'].nunique(),\n", "    '總訂單明細': len(df_integrated),\n", "    '總銷售額': df_integrated['price'].sum(),\n", "    '平均訂單值': df_integrated.groupby('order_id')['price'].sum().mean(),\n", "    '平均產品價格': df_integrated['price'].mean(),\n", "    '平均評分': df_integrated['review_score'].mean(),\n", "    '評分覆蓋率': df_integrated['review_score'].notna().sum() / df_integrated['order_id'].nunique() * 100,\n", "    '活躍州數': df_integrated['customer_state'].nunique(),\n", "    '產品類別數': df_integrated['product_category_name'].nunique(),\n", "    '監控期間': f\"{df_integrated['order_date'].min().date()} 至 {df_integrated['order_date'].max().date()}\"\n", "}\n", "\n", "for metric, value in summary_metrics.items():\n", "    if isinstance(value, float):\n", "        print(f\"  {metric}: {value:,.2f}\")\n", "    else:\n", "        print(f\"  {metric}: {value}\")\n", "\n", "# 5.2 TOP 10 分析\n", "print(\"\\n5.2 TOP 10 州 (按銷售額)\")\n", "top_states = state_kpi.head(10)\n", "for i, (state, row) in enumerate(top_states.iterrows(), 1):\n", "    print(f\"  {i}. {state:>5} - 銷售額: R$ {row['Total_Sales']:>12,.2f}, 訂單: {int(row['Orders']):>6}, 評分: {row['Avg_Rating']:.2f}\")\n", "\n", "print(\"\\n5.3 TOP 10 類別 (按銷售額)\")\n", "top_categories = category_kpi.head(10)\n", "for i, (cat, row) in enumerate(top_categories.iterrows(), 1):\n", "    print(f\"  {i}. {cat:>30} - 銷售額: R$ {row['Total_Sales']:>12,.2f}, 訂單: {int(row['Orders']):>6}, 評分: {row['Avg_Rating']:.2f}\")"]]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": {"text/plain": "\"## Step 6: 進階分析\""}, "source": "## Step 6: 進階分析"
  },
  {
   "cell_type": ["code", "execution_count": null, "metadata": {}, "outputs": [], "source": ["print(\"\\n\" + \"=\"*60)\n", "print(\"Step 6: 進階分析\")\n", "print(\"=\"*60)\n", "\n", "# 6.1 客戶分層\n", "print(\"\\n6.1 客戶分層分析\")\n", "customer_value = df_integrated.groupby('customer_id').agg({\n", "    'price': 'sum',\n", "    'order_id': 'nunique',\n", "    'review_score': 'mean'\n", "})\n", "\n", "customer_value.columns = ['Total_Spend', 'Orders', 'Avg_Rating']\n", "customer_value['Customer_Tier'] = pd.qcut(\n", "    customer_value['Total_Spend'],\n", "    q=4,\n", "    labels=['Bronze', 'Silver', 'Gold', 'Platinum'],\n", "    duplicates='drop'\n", ")\n", "\n", "tier_summary = customer_value.groupby('Customer_Tier').agg({\n", "    'Total_Spend': ['count', 'sum', 'mean'],\n", "    'Orders': 'mean',\n", "    'Avg_Rating': 'mean'\n", "})\n", "\n", "print(\"\\n客戶層級分布:\")\n", "print(tier_summary)\n", "\n", "# 6.2 交叉銷售分析\n", "print(\"\\n6.2 交叉銷售分析\")\n", "order_categories = df_integrated.groupby('order_id')['product_category_name'].nunique()\n", "\n", "cross_sell_dist = {\n", "    '單類購買': (order_categories == 1).sum(),\n", "    '雙類購買': (order_categories == 2).sum(),\n", "    '三類以上': (order_categories >= 3).sum()\n", "}\n", "\n", "print(\"\\n交叉銷售模式:\")\n", "for pattern, count in cross_sell_dist.items():\n", "    pct = count / len(order_categories) * 100\n", "    print(f\"  {pattern}: {count:,} 訂單 ({pct:.1f}%)\")\n", "\n", "# 6.3 評分與銷售關係\n", "print(\"\\n6.3 評分與銷售關係\")\n", "rating_sales = df_integrated.groupby('review_score').agg({\n", "    'price': ['sum', 'count', 'mean']\n", "})\n", "\n", "rating_sales.columns = ['Total_Sales', 'Item_Count', 'Avg_Price']\n", "print(\"\\n按評分的銷售分布:\")\n", "print(rating_sales)"]]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": {"text/plain": "\"## Step 7: 導出報表\""}, "source": "## Step 7: 導出報表"
  },
  {
   "cell_type": ["code", "execution_count": null, "metadata": {}, "outputs": [], "source": ["print(\"\\n\" + \"=\"*60)\n", "print(\"Step 7: 報表總結\")\n", "print(\"=\"*60)\n", "\n", "print(\"\"\"\n", "已完成的分析:\n", "\n", "1. MultiIndex 結構\n", "   ✓ 建立三維索引 (州-類別-月份)\n", "   ✓ 多層級數據組織\n", "\n", "2. 維度 KPI\n", "   ✓ 州級銷售、訂單、評分分析\n", "   ✓ 產品類別績效評估\n", "   ✓ 時間序列趨勢追蹤\n", "\n", "3. 透視表報表\n", "   ✓ 州-類別交叉分析\n", "   ✓ 時間-地區趨勢\n", "   ✓ 訂單狀態分布\n", "\n", "4. 進階洞察\n", "   ✓ 客戶分層模型\n", "   ✓ 交叉銷售模式\n", "   ✓ 評分與績效相關性\n", "\n", "5. 關鍵發現\n", "   - 確定高價值州和產品類別\n", "   - 識別客戶購買模式\n", "   - 量化評分對銷售的影響\n", "   - 發現季節性和趨勢\n", "\n", "應用場景:\n", "   - 銷售績效管理\n", "   - 庫存優化\n", "   - 市場拓展策略\n", "   - 客戶關係管理\n", "   - 產品組合優化\n", "\"\"\")"]]
  }
 ],
